               "16 KiB blockers on the embedder's mandatory path (PS-02 code buffer guard, PS-03 "
               "InterruptFaultPage) are fixed in the owned fork -- see "
               "docs/fex-host-page-size-adaptation.md -- but nothing drives FEXCore yet")
